<title>GERMANY: SKW Trostberg 9-mo sales rise 4 pct.</title>
<headline>SKW Trostberg 9-mo sales rise 4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>     Group sales				 2,970   vs 2,857</p>
<p>NOTE - The group also said nine month operating profit is at high year-ago levels. It did not give a figure. For the full year the group predicted it will post sales of 3.9 billion marks after 3.875 billion marks in 1995 and a net profit of 145 million marks after 120 million marks in 1995. Full name of German specialty chemicals group is SKW Trostberg AG. The group is located in Trostberg and is a unit of VIAG AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
